         <!--Aqundino et Proculo co[nsulibus olim nat]us / XI kal(endas) iulias die Beneris, qu[i v]ixsit annus XVIIII / et mensis III dies VI, depositus est V kal(endas) octobris Marcellinus / depositus in pace{m} Marcellinus se [viv]u fecit / ((monogramma Christi cum alpha et omega))--><div type="edition" xml:lang="la"><head>Text</head><ab><lb n="1"/>Aqundino et Proculo co<supplied reason="lost">nsulibus olim nat</supplied>us<lb n="2"/>XI <expan><abbr>kal</abbr><ex>endas</ex></expan> iulias die Beneris, qu<supplied reason="lost">i v</supplied>ixsit annus XVIIII<lb n="3"/>et mensis III dies VI, depositus est V <expan><abbr>kal</abbr><ex>endas</ex></expan> octobris Marcellinus<lb n="4"/>depositus in pace<surplus>m</surplus> Marcellinus se <supplied reason="lost">viv</supplied>u fecit<lb n="5"/><g type="descriptive">monogramma Christi cum alpha et omega</g></ab></div>
